    <string name="settings_help">Help</string>
    <string name="settings_help_body">UA Cast Player is a personal IPTV player. Import a playlist from the Channels tab (by URL or file), pick a TV guide source, and tap any channel to start watching. Use the Cast button to play on a Chromecast or Google TV device; if a stream can\'t be played directly on the receiver, the app automatically retries through a local relay on your phone.</string>
